{'symbol': 'BMY', 'date': '2020-05-14 20:30:00', 'title': 'Bluebird Bio To Present Updated Positive Results From Phase 2 Karmma Study At ASCO20', 'text': 'BRISTOL MYERS SQUIBB AND BLUEBIRD BIO TO PRESENT UPDATED POSITIVE RESULTS FROM PIVOTAL KARMMA STUDY OF IDE-CEL IN RELAPSED AND REFRACTORY MULTIPLE MYELOMA PATIENTS AT ASCO20.BLUEBIRD BIO - IDE-CEL, AN INVESTIGATIONAL CAR T CELL THERAPY FOR MULTIPLE MYELOMA, MET PRIMARY ENDPOINT AND KEY SECONDARY ENDPOINTS.BLUEBIRD BIO - CLINICALLY MEANINGFUL BENEFIT WAS CONSISTENTLY OBSERVED ACROSS SUBGROUPS IN PHASE 2 KARMMA STUDY.BLUEBIRD BIO - IN PHASE 2 KARMMA STUDY, OVERALL SURVIVAL DATA CONTINUE TO MATURE, WITH AN ESTIMATED MEDIAN OS OF 19.4 MONTHS ACROSS ALL DOSE LEVELS.BLUEBIRD BIO - IN PHASE 2 KARMMA STUDY, OVERALL SURVIVAL DATA CONTINUE TO MATURE, WITH 78% OF PATIENTS ALIVE AT 12 MONTHS.BLUEBIRD BIO - IN PHASE 2 KARMMA STUDY, MEDIAN DURATION OF RESPONSE WAS 10.7 MONTHS, WITH 19 MONTH FOR THOSE WITH COMPLETE RESPONSE/STRINGENT CR.BLUEBIRD BIO - IN PHASE 2 KARMMA STUDY, MEDIAN PROGRESSION-FREE SURVIVAL WAS 8.8 MONTHS, WITH 20.2 MONTH MEDIAN PFS FOR PATIENTS WHO HAD A CR OR SCR.BLUEBIRD BIO - IN PHASE 2 KARMMA STUDY, ALL PATIENTS WHO HAD CR OR SCR AND WERE EVALUABLE FOR MINIMAL RESIDUAL DISEASE (MRD), WERE MRD-NEGATIVE.BLUEBIRD BIO - IN PHASE 2 KARMMA STUDY, MOST FREQUENTLY REPORTED ADVERSE EVENTS (AES) WERE CYTOPENIA AND CYTOKINE RELEASE SYNDROME (CRS).BLUEBIRD BIO - IN PHASE 2 KARMMA STUDY, GRADE 3 OR HIGHER CRS OCCURRED IN LESS THAN OR EQUAL TO 6% OF PATIENTS, WITH ONE FATAL CRS EVENT.'}
{'symbol': 'CCL', 'date': '2020-05-14 10:30:00', 'title': 'Carnival Announces Layoffs, Furloughs, And Salary Reductions', 'text': 'CARNIVAL CORPORATION ANNOUNCES ADDITIONAL STEPS TO FURTHER STRENGTHEN ABILITY TO MANAGE THROUGH EXTENDED PAUSE IN GUEST OPERATIONS.CARNIVAL CORP - ANNOUNCING A COMBINATION OF LAYOFFS, FURLOUGHS, REDUCED WORK WEEKS AND SALARY REDUCTIONS.CARNIVAL CORP - MOVES WILL CONTRIBUTE HUNDREDS OF MILLIONS OF DOLLARS IN CASH CONSERVATION ON AN ANNUALIZED BASIS..CARNIVAL CORP - CONTINUES TO SUPPORT ITS TRAVEL AGENT PARTNERS BY PAYING COMMISSIONS ON CANCELED CRUISES AND ON FUTURE CRUISE CREDITS.CARNIVAL - REPATRIATION EFFORTS BY CO INCLUDE CHARTERED FLIGHTS, REROUTING SHIPS TO CREW HOME PORTS WHERE THOSE SHIPS WOULD NOT HAVE OTHERWISE SAILED.CARNIVAL CORP - BOOKING TRENDS FOR FIRST HALF OF 2021 REMAIN WITHIN HISTORICAL RANGES.CARNIVAL CORP - PLAN TO STAGGER FLEET REENTRY TO OPTIMIZE DEMAND AND OPERATING PERFORMANCE OVER TIME.CARNIVAL CORP - MAJORITY OF GUESTS AFFECTED BY SCHEDULE CHANGES WANT TO SAIL AT LATER DATE, WITH FEWER THAN 38% REQUESTING REFUNDS TO DATE.'}
